ce different  bloodlines based on that right so  literally it just kind of gets passed on  and passed on it's really cool you get  to like create your own evolution of  errors and there's no limit to what you  guys can do this feature alone was  enough for me to get into it i was like  okay i want to see how far this  stretches so having said that make sure  you guys check the link in the  description or you can scan the qr code  that's showing on screen right now and  you can use my gift code in the  description to get in-game rewards  you'll get one champion token and then  100 diamonds which is really really cool  so make sure you guys check that out and  let's get back into our video  so with zom having been locked away by  eternity right off the bat if zom is a  big enough threat that eternity thought  he needed to be locked away forever we  know we're dealing with an incredibly  powerful guy a notion that the ancient  one confirms when he states that  although zom is the only entity that can  defeat umar the cure may end up being  worse than the sickness if zom is  released nevertheless strange decides  that he has no choice but to liberate  zom which he does and as he breaks forth  from his prison zom exclaims let the  world within and the worlds without  tremble in their orbits zom lives again  so immediately we know that zom's ready  to just start screwing stuff up  immediately after being freed and he  even says that he plans to shatter world  after world with ease now predictably  zomb tries to kill doctor strange but  strange basically runs away and leaves  zomb right to umar who proclaims that  his power dwarfs her own and we also  learned that in order for eternity to  imprison zom zom first had to be bound  by dormammu so it took the collective  effort of two beyond omega level  characters to imprison this guy so umar  tries to fight zom for like a few  seconds and then she just pieces out i  mean she literally says this is useless  i'm just gonna vanish and then  disappears so this villain who's more  powerful than dormammu just runs away  instead of fighting zom but with the  threat of umar neutralized zam decides  that he must have a victim so he sets  his sights on doctor strange and the  ancient one and after slaying them he  vows to destroy all mankind before  moving on to destroy other worlds now as  soon as the battle begins the ancient  one realizes the only move he has is to  sacrifice himself and transfer all his  power to doctor strange before he dies  however he tells dr strange that the  secret to defeating zomb is the forelock  and this is where things go off the  rails so after being momentarily  confused as to what his master was  talking about strange deduces that the  forelock refers to the strands of hair  on the front of zom's head basically his  bangs so strange flies up to zom and  uses his amulet to slice off zom's bangs  or azan calls it his mystic top knot now  even with the four lock severed strange  is no match for zom but the reason  removing it was key to victory is that  the removal of the four locks summoned  the living tribunal and this was the  first time we'd ever seen the tribunal  and if you're not familiar with him i  have done a video on him already that  you can basically check out but  essentially he's the most powerful  entity in marvel comics except for the  one above all and anybody else that  marvel just arbitrarily decides is more  powerful the beyonders the molecule man  owen reese the fedex guys who actually  deliver packages on time for a change  but the living tribunal's purpose is to  maintain balance in the universe and he  sees zom and decides that he must be  returned to his prison and then declares  that doctor strange must face the  tribunal's judgment for unleashing a  force that threatens the worlds beyond  so the next time we see zom is on  another occasion many years later when  once again doctor strange believes  releasing him is the only way to save  